  "title": "Chicken Meatballs and Spaghetti",
  "description": "This chicken meatballs and spaghetti recipe simmers meatballs in a homemade tomato sauce, seasoned with basil, and served over whole wheat spaghetti.",
  "authors": [
    "Kimberly Anne Thomas"
  ],
